            ("What type of semiconductor is created by doping pure silicon with pentavalent Group V donor atoms like phosphorus or arsenic?", "N-type semiconductor", ["P-type semiconductor", "Intrinsic semiconductor", "Compensated semiconductor"], "Pentavalent atoms donate a fifth loosely bound valence electron, creating abundant mobile conduction-band electrons."),
