            ("What phenomenon in CMOS integrated circuits occurs when parasitic bipolar structures trigger an unintended low-impedance short circuit?", "CMOS Latch-Up", ["Thermal Runaway", "Electromigration", "Oxide Breakdown"], "Voltage spikes or radiation can trigger parasitic thyristor latch-up across VDD and GND, burning out the chip unless power is removed."),
