            ("What power device combines an isolated MOS gate with a bipolar output, standardly used in high-voltage industrial motor drives above 600V?", "Insulated Gate Bipolar Transistor (IGBT)", ["Power MOSFET", "Darlington Transistor", "JFET"], "IGBTs eliminate high gate drive current while avoiding the high on-resistance penalty that limits silicon power MOSFETs above 600V.")
