            ("What advanced binary adder computes all carry bits simultaneously in parallel using generate and propagate logic?", "Carry-Lookahead Adder (CLA)", ["Ripple Carry Adder", "Serial Adder", "Manchester Adder"], "CLA circuits compute carry bits in constant time using generate and propagate terms, eliminating ripple delay."),
