            ("What digital circuit converts an n-bit binary input code into a maximum of 2^n unique active output lines?", "Binary Decoder", ["Encoder", "Multiplexer", "Comparator"], "Decoders activate one specific output line corresponding to the binary value applied to input address lines."),
