            ("What table in microcontroller program memory stores the memory addresses of all Interrupt Service Routines?", "Interrupt Vector Table (IVT)", ["Look-Up Table", "Stack Pointer Table", "Symbol Table"], "Hardware indexes into the IVT upon an interrupt, executing the handler code mapped to that specific hardware event."),
